			"notes": "## Changelog\nSee [0.6.0.md](https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/blob/main/changelog/0.6.0.md) for a comprehensive overview of this release.\n\n## Merged Pull Requests\n* adds method getIsDebugModeActive() to ScriptEffect class by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/115\n* Fix Cake consume by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/110\n* Prevents Cake and Repeater from being placed outside of Debug Mode by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/107\n* New property canSleep to toggle, if player can sleep in beds by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/108\n* Adds toggle option for hoe usability outside of Debug Mode by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/109\n* Fix: Adds possibility to disable bonemeal usage outside of debug mode by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/113\n* Fixes slow destroy speed, while not being on ground by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/111\n* Fix: Adds building on y = 127 by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/112\n* fix runCreatedScript scope (workaround) by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/116\n* Fix: Remember current slots by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/118\n* [Feature] Combine toggle commands in /gamerule by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/121\n* Add missing methods on ScriptModel* by @Gordon-Neb in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/106\n* Big code cleanup, optimizations, and RegionFile buffering by @TechPizzaDev in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/122\n* [Fix] custom mob and NPC setOnCreated potential fix by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/123\n* Refactor/paste and nudge by @RyuuSlayer in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/125\n* New chunk renderer by @TechPizzaDev in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/130\n* More NBT Data for custom tags   by @Hormez2 in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/131\n* Fixes Nudge out of bounds error + wrong move direction by @PuckyAC in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/132\n* Cleanup additions by @Hormez2 in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/133\n* Custom Tags by @Hormez2 in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/134\n* Allow nested JS top-call by @TechPizzaDev in https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/pull/136\n\n**Full Commit Changelog**: https://github.com/Adventurecraft-Awakening/AC-Legacy-Mod/compare/0.5.4.5...0.6.0"
		},
